---
const nav = [
  { label: "Start Here", href: "/start-here" },
  { label: "Faith", href: "/faith" },
  { label: "History", href: "/history" },
  { label: "Society", href: "/society" },
  { label: "World", href: "/world" },
  { label: "People", href: "/people" },
  { label: "Archive", href: "/archive" },
  { label: "Books", href: "/books" },
];
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Ateshism — The world of The Ashen Flame</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Ateshism.com is the archive of a fictional faith and empire — theology, history, and society built for the novel The Ashen Flame by Alexei Sassani." />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="ember-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

		<header>
			<div class="wrap header-inner">
				<a class="wordmark" href="/">Ateshism<span class="dot">.com</span></a>
				<nav>
					{nav.map((item) => (
						<a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>
					))}
				</nav>
				<a class="buy" href="/the-ashen-flame">The Ashen Flame</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero wrap">
				<p class="kicker">A civilisation built for one novel — and the ones after it</p>
				<h1>
					Somewhere, a fire has been<br />
					burning for twelve centuries.
				</h1>
				<p class="lede">
					Ateshism.com is the archive of Din e Atezhan — the faith, empire, and people
					of the Ateshi world — built to stand beside <em>The Ashen Flame</em>,
					a novel by Alexei Sassani. Fictional, and documented like it isn't.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-links">
					<a class="cta-primary" href="/the-ashen-flame">Read about the novel</a>
					<a class="cta-secondary" href="/start-here">Enter the world</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="wrap divider"><hr /></section>

			<section class="wrap intro-grid">
				<div class="intro-block">
					<h2>What is Ateshism?</h2>
					<p>
						Not a god who judges from a distance, but the Eternal Flame — the ongoing
						activity of existence itself, present everywhere, legible unevenly.
						A faith with two scriptures three centuries apart, and a question about
						the second one it has never fully answered.
					</p>
					<a class="text-link" href="/faith/what-is-ateshism">What is Ateshism?</a>
				</div>
				<div class="intro-block">
					<h2>Rose Mothers and the Ash Order</h2>
					<p>
						Provincial clergy who marry and bury and teach, and an independent order
						that investigates them — disciplinary authority built to check power,
						not just bless it.
					</p>
					<a class="text-link" href="/institutions/the-ash-order">The Ash Order</a>
				</div>
				<div class="intro-block">
					<h2>The world in 1991</h2>
					<p>
						From Persia to Sogdiana to the Baltics — a defense-in-depth empire,
						not an expeditionary one, and the modern Compact it became.
					</p>
					<a class="text-link" href="/world">Map of the Ateshi world</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="wrap divider"><hr /></section>

			<section class="wrap book-panel">
				<div class="book-copy">
					<p class="kicker">The novel</p>
					<h2>The Ashen Flame</h2>
					<p>
						An Ash Mother named Farah Kianzad opens an investigation that was never
						supposed to go where it goes. Everything on this site exists because the
						book needed a world large enough to hold it.
					</p>
					<a class="cta-primary" href="/the-ashen-flame">Buy the novel</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<div class="wrap footer-inner">
				<span>Alexei Sassani</span>
				<span class="sep">·</span>
				<a href="/about">About the project</a>
				<span class="sep">·</span>
				<a href="/contact">Contact</a>
				<span class="sep">·</span>
				<a href="/fiction-notice">Fiction notice</a>
				<span class="sep">·</span>
				<a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a>
			</div>
			<div class="wrap fiction-notice">
				Ateshism, Din e Atezhan, and the Ateshi world are fictional, created for the
				novel <em>The Ashen Flame</em>. They are not a real religion, place, or history.
			</div>
		</footer>

		<style>
			:root {
				--ash-950: #171310;
				--ash-900: #221b16;
				--ash-800: #332821;
				--ash-700: #4a3a30;
				--parchment: #ece2d0;
				--parchment-dim: #c9bda8;
				--ember: #b8481f;
				--ember-bright: #d9642f;
				--gold-line: rgba(201, 189, 168, 0.18);
			}

			* { box-sizing: border-box; }

			html {
				background: var(--ash-950);
			}

			body {
				margin: 0;
				background: var(--ash-950);
				background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 500px at 15% -10%, rgba(184, 72, 31, 0.14), transparent 60%);
				color: var(--parchment);
				font-family: "IBM Plex Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
				font-size: 17px;
				line-height: 1.6;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			h1, h2, .wordmark {
				font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
			}

			.wrap {
				max-width: 980px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 28px;
			}

			.ember-rule {
				height: 3px;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ember) 0%, var(--ember-bright) 40%, transparent 100%);
			}

			header {
				padding: 22px 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-line);
			}

			.header-inner {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 32px;
			}

			.wordmark {
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				color: var(--parchment);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.wordmark .dot {
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				font-weight: 400;
			}

			nav {
				display: flex;
				gap: 22px;
				flex: 1;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			nav a {
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.92rem;
			}

			nav a:hover {
				color: var(--parchment);
			}

			.buy {
				color: var(--ember-bright);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				white-space: nowrap;
				border: 1px solid rgba(217, 100, 47, 0.4);
				padding: 7px 14px;
				border-radius: 3px;
			}

			.buy:hover {
				background: rgba(217, 100, 47, 0.1);
			}

			.hero {
				padding: 88px 28px 56px;
				max-width: 760px;
			}

			.kicker {
				color: var(--ember-bright);
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				margin: 0 0 18px;
			}

			.hero h1 {
				font-size: 3.1rem;
				line-height: 1.12;
				margin: 0 0 26px;
				color: var(--parchment);
			}

			.lede {
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				max-width: 58ch;
				margin: 0 0 34px;
			}

			.lede em {
				color: var(--parchment);
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.hero-links {
				display: flex;
				gap: 16px;
			}

			.cta-primary {
				background: var(--ember);
				color: var(--parchment);
				text-decoration: none;
				padding: 12px 22px;
				border-radius: 3px;
				font-size: 0.98rem;
			}

			.cta-primary:hover {
				background: var(--ember-bright);
			}

			.cta-secondary {
				color: var(--parchment);
				text-decoration: none;
				padding: 12px 22px;
				border: 1px solid var(--ash-700);
				border-radius: 3px;
				font-size: 0.98rem;
			}

			.cta-secondary:hover {
				border-color: var(--parchment-dim);
			}

			.divider hr {
				border: none;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-line);
				margin: 0;
			}

			.intro-grid {
				padding: 56px 28px;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
				gap: 44px;
			}

			.intro-block h2 {
				font-size: 1.3rem;
				margin: 0 0 12px;
				color: var(--parchment);
			}

			.intro-block p {
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				font-size: 0.98rem;
				margin: 0 0 16px;
			}

			.text-link {
				color: var(--ember-bright);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(217, 100, 47, 0.35);
				padding-bottom: 1px;
			}

			.text-link:hover {
				border-color: var(--ember-bright);
			}

			.book-panel {
				padding: 60px 28px 90px;
			}

			.book-copy {
				max-width: 560px;
			}

			.book-copy h2 {
				font-size: 2rem;
				margin: 10px 0 18px;
			}

			.book-copy p {
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				font-size: 1.05rem;
				margin: 0 0 26px;
			}

			footer {
				border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-line);
				padding: 30px 0 40px;
			}

			.footer-inner {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 10px;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
			}

			.footer-inner a {
				color: var(--parchment-dim);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.footer-inner a:hover {
				color: var(--parchment);
			}

			.sep {
				color: var(--ash-700);
			}

			.fiction-notice {
				margin-top: 14px;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: var(--ash-700);
				max-width: 640px;
			}

			.fiction-notice em {
				font-style: italic;
			}

			@media (max-width: 760px) {
				.header-inner {
					flex-wrap: wrap;
				}
				nav {
					order: 3;
					gap: 14px;
				}
				.hero h1 {
					font-size: 2.2rem;
				}
				.intro-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 34px;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
